AB  - We report a 9-year old girl with an unusual presentation of granulomatosis with 
      polyangiitis in association with Marfan phenotype. The patient presented with 
      recurrent sinusitis, epistaxis, hearing loss and hyperplastic gingivitis, without 
      any signs or symptoms of major organ involvement.
