TI  - Foreign Body Stocked between Vocal Cords.
PG  - 246-248
AB  - Foreign body (FB) aspiration is a rare event in adults and can mimic other 
      pathologies such as refractory asthma. Most of the objects can be removed using a 
      bronchoscope. Herein, we present a unique case of aspiration of a FB stocked 
      between vocal cords for one week and the anesthetic considerations.
