TI  - Omalizumab for severe allergic asthma: 7 years and open questions.
PG  - 158-61
LID - 10.1159/000360771 [doi]
AB  - Anti-IgE treatment for severe allergic asthma has been available for more than 
      seven years now. This treatment has clear clinical benefits and a good safety 
      record. However, important questions concerning long-term dosing and treatment 
      duration remain unanswered. This paper discusses the available information 
      concerning the long-term use of omalizumab.
