TI  - A case of drug-induced pneumonitis caused by carvedilol.
PG  - 650-2
AB  - We present a case of drug- induced pneumonitis caused by carvedilol. Forty days 
      after drug cessation, there was almost complete resolution of pulmonary 
      infiltrates. This is the first report of pneumonitis caused by carvedilol.
