      company, outside the scope of the submitted work. The remaining authors declared 
      no financial conflicts of interest with pharmaceutical companies. Regarding 
      nonfinancial conflicts of interest among the study authors, all are engaged in 
      ongoing research examining financial and nonfinancial conflicts of interest among 
      healthcare professionals and pharmaceutical companies in Japan. Individually, 
