AB  - Giant cell interstitial pneumonia is a form of pulmonary fibrosis usually caused 
      by exposure to hard metals. We report a case of giant cell interstitial pneumonia 
      in a 60-year-old female office worker who was a non-smoker and did not have any 
      exposure to hard metals.
